    body: "The 2021 Tokyo Olympics, women's featherweight boxing. Sena Irie advanced from the preliminary rounds to the final with meticulous wins. No flashy knockouts. But in every bout, she calmly read her opponent's attacks and landed precise counters.\n\nThe \"reactions\" and \"precision\" she had refined during her slump blossomed on the Olympic stage. \"The frustration of losing becomes the finest essence for the next victory.\" Just as she said, every loss during the slump had become nourishment for her Olympic campaign.\n\nIn the final, against a formidable Filipino opponent, Irie fought with both composure and audacity to claim victory.",
